      "content": "that's helpful, thanks. i was also reading something about how clinical assessments for things like pain levels or even certain neurological issues can vary by race. i've heard some older studies mention differences in pain threshold or sensitivity between different ethnic groups. is there any clinical basis for that that i should be aware of for the exam?",
